                      "title": "What is a Linear Equation?",
                      "content": "An equation says two mathematical expressions are equal. In a linear equation in one variable, the unknown variable appears only with an exponent of 1 (first power), like 2x + 5 = 17.\n\nTo solve it, we perform inverse operations equally on both sides to isolate the variable while keeping the equation balanced.",
